r VirtualMedia est n\u00e9cessaire pour utiliser l'application.", "short_description": "Consultez vos visites virtuelles 360\u00b0 en immersion totale, en ligne ou hors-ligne, directement sur votre casque Meta Quest."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon-512.png", "id": "2122307235195493", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830589_2122307238528826_4682676750819233454_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xUTbkIr7dj0Q7kNvwEpfNtj&_nc_oc=Adpgp272H8lSZDDI9UpxNzbMFGx-5rTJSn3_S1b2G7WQRW2KD2mg83Ig8i-wchPvOvE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL4Oz33w_KFv5tXU8XEqiD-tg6K1rg3OY0Zrm8XzkWU3g&oe=6AA94F08"}, {"file_name": "cover-3000x900.png", "id": "1660491348599271", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819982_1660491351932604_6639634371189907405_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=96bmZ_rNqLwQ7kNvwHonhrR&_nc_oc=AdrZ0YdKCjWt_37VZGdub9q3DmBRwCaMsqKJ9Xg4EiLAF6dJD-1_XjAFHWwb_GqY6kI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLAilC8SoMsleMzw1RZ5PNP-TrfQFlnsrfVxihCn6FZdw&oe=6AA936A5"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1.png", "id": "1597698424812444", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1597698428145777_3649643537659495719_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UnWihsSyBocQ7kNvwG8IbqP&_nc_oc=AdoLG-qZGE8v_ebXlsMfQ7nDzzUKxlW-92CsDPVTCQ56EtjcsJCVes8XD6c6sQxaltA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjp-4FTzEtWqwEB9aAz4opqmPHKkPMBHhLuDlVEY2nZg&oe=6AA96449"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1-1008-1440.png", "id": "952713727187791", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_952713730521124_5588950475353037424_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PSj3ABelVhMQ7kNvwEQZkNS&_nc_oc=AdpLrHjqBi9UZJ-38809E3kQ_vzos5OWcnpm